Indicator: Construction and commissioning of 1000 solar and solar-wind street lighting systems in Bhaktapur, Kathmandu and Lalitpur 
Progress/Status: 1,501 PV solar street lights have been installed in Kathmandu valley. 100 kWp solar gird tied system installed in NEA training centre,60 kWp in Bir Hospital (50 kWp grid connected system + 10 kWp solar backup systems) 
Data Source: Quarterly progress reports
