Indicator: Excitation system of Marshyangdi plant and weir control system of Gandak plant replaced 
Progress/Status: Weir Control System has been installed at Marsyangdi HPP. Installation is at advance stage. Trashrack panels delivered, TRCM dispatched from Rehabilitation of Marsyangdi Hydropower Station completed.Installation of Trash Rack and overhead crane for Gandak Hydropower Station completed.Testing and Commissioning of TRCM has been completed. 
